# Firebase client config. Holds no private key -- the API key inside it ships
# in every APK anyway -- but this repo is public, and the file names a specific
# Firebase project. Each deployment should fetch its OWN, per SETUP.md:
#   firebase apps:sdkconfig ANDROID <APP_ID> --project <YOUR_PROJECT> --out \
#     apps/mobile/android/app/google-services.json
# CI does not need it: the Flutter job runs pub get / analyze / test, none of
# which invoke the Google Services Gradle plugin. Only an APK build does.
android/app/google-services.json
ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist
